{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the joy of a classic childhood game on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the perfect timing, angle, and force for the ultimate kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Rules]<br>Swing on the swing and launch your shoe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick off with your right foot and left foot once each\u2014compete with the total score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[How to Play]<br>Press the button with good timing to swing higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve built up speed, launch your shoe! The angle will change how far and where it flies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you send your shoe flying?! Aim for a new personal best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle Mode]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice solo or compete for the farthest distance with family and friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against players from around the world in Online Battles!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994160?t=1756853498","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994160?t=1756853498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994160/a9d93daacd097706fca60fbeea32aab4d9579594/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756853498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994160/a9d93daacd097706fca60fbeea32aab4d9579594/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756853498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play To